      "explanation": "ConcurrentNativeOperatorRequestsShareTheSinglePersistedRotation never observed userinfoPauses. PlatformRoleJourneyTests.cs:98 waits for the second request at the external producer while the first refresh is held; WaitForObservation polls 100 times with 50ms delay. Inspect the second request outcome and explicit session/producer barriers; make ordering deterministic before extending a timeout."
