    },
    "webhook-transport-race": {
      "unique_primary_run_count": 2,
      "run_ids": [
        39876417752,
        39882594788
      ],
      "status": "Unresolved transport race candidate",
      "explanation": "OversizedWebhookAllowsFollowUpPostOnSameClientPool(False, 65537) threw HttpRequestException/Broken pipe while sending the rejected upload. StripeWebhookEndpoints.cs:23/50 immediately returns 413 plus Connection: close beyond its drain allowance; HttpClient can still be writing. Fix/reproduce the upload-versus-close handshake or rejection drain lifecycle; keep the follow-up POST check and do not mask it with generic retries."
    },
